### Stage 5 - Repair Management
### Use IntelliJ HTTP Client. Replace credentials/IDs with yours.
@base = http://localhost:8081
@company = 1
@repair = 1
@part = 1
@employee = 2

### 1: Customer creates a repair (Basic Auth: customer credentials)
POST {{base}}/api/companies/{{company}}/repairs
Authorization: Basic customer@example.com DemoPassword123!
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceType": "Mobile phone",
  "brand": "Samsung",
  "model": "S24",
  "issueDescription": "Screen is cracked; touch response intermittent"
}

### 2: Customer views only their repairs
GET {{base}}/api/companies/{{company}}/repairs/mine
Authorization: Basic customer@example.com DemoPassword123!

### 3: Company owner/manager assigns employee by user ID
PUT {{base}}/api/companies/{{company}}/repairs/{{repair}}/assignment
Authorization: Basic owner@example.com DemoPassword123!
Content-Type: application/json

{"employeeId": {{employee}}}

### 4: Assigned employee (or manager) begins diagnosis
POST {{base}}/api/companies/{{company}}/repairs/{{repair}}/status
Authorization: Basic owner@example.com DemoPassword123!
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"DIAGNOSING","note":"Diagnosis started"}

### 5: Manager sets labor charge and internal cost
PUT {{base}}/api/companies/{{company}}/repairs/{{repair}}/labor
Authorization: Basic owner@example.com DemoPassword123!
Content-Type: application/json

{"laborCharge":100.00,"laborCost":35.00}

### 6: Employee uses inventory part (deducts stock, saves price snapshot)
POST {{base}}/api/companies/{{company}}/repairs/{{repair}}/parts
Authorization: Basic owner@example.com DemoPassword123!
Content-Type: application/json

{"itemId": {{part}}, "quantity":1}

### 7: Progress to repair-in-progress
POST {{base}}/api/companies/{{company}}/repairs/{{repair}}/status
Authorization: Basic owner@example.com DemoPassword123!
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"IN_PROGRESS","note":"Screen being replaced"}

### 8: Mark finished
POST {{base}}/api/companies/{{company}}/repairs/{{repair}}/status
Authorization: Basic owner@example.com DemoPassword123!
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"COMPLETED","note":"Repair finished; ready for pickup"}

### 9: Manager marks delivery
POST {{base}}/api/companies/{{company}}/repairs/{{repair}}/status
Authorization: Basic owner@example.com DemoPassword123!
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"DELIVERED","note":"Collected by customer"}

### 10: View repair detail as owner (includes internal costs)
GET {{base}}/api/companies/{{company}}/repairs/{{repair}}
Authorization: Basic owner@example.com DemoPassword123!

### 11: Repair estimated gross-profit summary (manager only)
GET {{base}}/api/companies/{{company}}/finance/repair-summary
Authorization: Basic owner@example.com DemoPassword123!
